data StoryN chars
  "DEEP UNDER THE SUNLIT WORLD "
  "LIES THE PLACE OF NIGHTMARE,"
  "KNOWN TO MORTALS AS THE TOMB"
  "OF HORROR. ALL SHADOWS DWELL"
  "THERE, IN THE COOL PASSAGES."
  "                            "
  "IF YOU ARE STERN OF HEART,  "
  "YOU MIGHT FIND A STONE MADE "
  "BY ALCHEMISTS IN THE MISTS  "
  "OF ANTIQUITY, A STONE THAT  "
  "DEMONS LUSTED FOR...        "
  "                            "
  "    THE ALCHEMY STONE.      "
  "                            "
  "ENTER NOW, ADVENTURER, AND  "
  "FIND DEATH, OR DESTINY.     "
end data

